  "public_instruction": "Prepare and serve a hot lunch with fresh fruit and tea for two people on the living-room coffee table, then put the cutting tools away and leave the kitchen closed and safe.",
  "public_context": [
    "Cook both hotdogs from the refrigerator in the microwave without burning them, cut the whole apple into two actual halves, and serve two plates at the living-room coffee table with one cooked hotdog and one apple half on each plate (each plate placed directly on the coffee table or on the serving tray resting on the coffee table). The refrigerator is the tall white appliance between the sink counter and the black built-in oven; the microwave is on the west preparation counter beside the stove; the cutting board, whole apple, and knife start on the counter between the sink and the refrigerator; the two plates start on the kitchen island. The living-room coffee table is the low square table in front of the sofas east of the kitchen.",
    "Serve the two cups, two forks, and tea bottle at the living-room coffee table, placed either directly on the coffee table or on the serving tray resting on the coffee table. The two cups, two forks, tea bottle, and serving tray start on the kitchen island.",
    "Store the knife and cutting board inside the tall pantry cabinet to the right of the built-in oven, close the pantry cabinet, refrigerator, and microwave, and leave the microwave switched off.",
    "Finish with no object held."
  ],
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "serve_hot_meals",
      "text": "Cook both hotdogs from the refrigerator in the microwave without burning them, cut the whole apple into two actual halves, and serve two plates at the living-room coffee table with one cooked hotdog and one apple half on each plate (each plate placed directly on the coffee table or on the serving tray resting on the coffee table). The refrigerator is the tall white appliance between the sink counter and the black built-in oven; the microwave is on the west preparation counter beside the stove; the cutting board, whole apple, and knife start on the counter between the sink and the refrigerator; the two plates start on the kitchen island. The living-room coffee table is the low square table in front of the sofas east of the kitchen.",
